Understanding the existing system – Deep diving into Tableau and Pega implementations.

Engaging business users – Capturing use cases and critical functionalities.

Performing a detailed technical analysis – Categorizing systems, documenting architecture, data flow, deployment, and integrations.

Conducting Proof of Concepts (POCs) – Demonstrating feasibility and business value.

Managing cross-team collaboration – Ensuring smooth coordination with multiple teams without disrupting their ongoing work.

Action (Ongoing Work & Progress So Far):

