Partnered with onshore and offshore Tableau teams to analyze dashboard dependencies and pain points.

Engaged with business users to prioritize dashboards based on impact.

Completed a POC, showcasing performance improvements and cloud integration.

Designed a scalable data pipeline for seamless data ingestion and visualization.

Currently working on a phased migration plan that minimizes disruptions while aligning with business needs.

