Engaged with Pega specialists to assess existing workflows and business rules.

Completed a POC for re-architecting workflows using a microservices-based approach, improving flexibility and automation.

Defined a structured migration strategy, ensuring compliance with operational and regulatory requirements.

Currently in the process of integrating key functionalities into the new system while ensuring a smooth transition for users.

🔹 Cross-Team Collaboration & Leadership

Lead as an Owner: Taken full ownership of dependencies, driving coordination across business, engineering, and platform teams.

Create Exceptional Teams: Fostered cross-team collaboration, scheduling non-intrusive knowledge-sharing sessions with onshore and offshore teams.

Ensured teams can continue their regular deliverables while actively contributing to the modernization effort.

Proactively addressed roadblocks by aligning key stakeholders, ensuring progress without bottlenecks.

Current Status & Next Steps:
✅ POCs Completed for both Tableau and Pega migration.
🚧 Migration Planning & Implementation Ongoing, ensuring minimal disruption to operations.
🔜 Iterative Rollout Strategy – Implementing phased deployments with regular business validation.

The project remains a collaborative effort across multiple teams, and our structured approach ensures we stay aligned with business goals while maintaining agility in execution.

